lg0005.tlg001.perseus-grc1:22:56"},"; ",{"g":"τί φῄς;"}," what say you? i.e. what think you? (v. infr. ",{"c":"11.5","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0005.tlg001.perseus-grc1:11:5"},"); ",{"g":"λέγ' ἀνύσας ὅ τι φῄς"},{"c":"Ar. Pl. 349","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0019.tlg011.perseus-grc1:349"},":—so ",{"g":"φ. δεῖν, φ. χρῆναι,"}," deem it right, ",{"c":"And. 3.34","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0027.tlg003.perseus-grc1:34"},", ",{"c":"Isoc. 3.48","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0010.tlg014.perseus-grc1:48"},". "]],[4,"c",[" say, i.e. write, of an author, ",{"g":"ὡς ἔφημεν"}," Gal. 1.158, etc.—The Med. has all these senses as well as the Act. "]],[2,"II",[" Special Phrases: "]],[3,"1",[{"g":"φασί,"}," they say, it is said, ",{"c":"Il. 5.638","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0012.tlg001.perseus-grc1:5:638"},", ",{"c":"Od. 6.42","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0012.tlg002.perseus-grc1:6:42"},", etc.; parenthetically, ",{"c":"Arist. EN 1109a35","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0086.tlg010.perseus-grc1:1109a:35"},", ",{"c":"Men. Epit. 223","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0541.tlg009:223"},", etc.: Prose writers use ",{"g":"φησί"}," when quoting, ",{"c":"D. 23.89","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0014.tlg023.perseus-grc1:89"},", etc.; ",{"g":"φησίν"}," saith He, ",{"c":"1 Ep.Cor. 6.16","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0031.tlg007.perseus-grc1:6:16"},"; esp. of an opponent's objection, Plu. 2.112c; even after a plural, ",{"g":"ὅ τοίνυν μέγιστον ἔχειν οἴονται . . \"καὶ αὐτός\", φησί, \"τῶν εἰσιόντων ἦσθα\""},{"c":"Lib. Or. 52.39","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg2200.tlg004:52:39"},"; \"",{"g":"τὸν δὲ μετ' εἰσενόησα\", ἔφη Ὅμηρος"}," as H. said, ",{"c":"Pl. Prt. 315b","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0059.tlg022:315b"},". "]],[3,"2",[" joined with a synon. Verb, ",{"g":"ἔφη λέγων, ἔφησε λέγων,"},{"c":"Hdt. 3.156","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0016.tlg001.perseus-grc1:3:156"},", ",{"c":"6.137","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0016.tlg001.perseus-grc1:6:137"},", etc.; ",{"g":"ἔλεγε φάς"},{"c":"Id. 1.122","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0016.tlg001.perseus-grc1:1:122"},"; ",{"g":"λέγει οὐδέν, φαμένη"},".. ",{"c":"Id. 2.22","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0016.tlg001.perseus-grc1:2:22"},"; ",{"g":"τί ἐροῦμεν ἢ τί φήσομεν;"},{"c":"D. 8.37","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0014.tlg008.perseus-grc1:37"},", cf. ",{"c":"25.100","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0014.tlg025.perseus-grc1:100"},"; ",{"g":"τί φῶ; τί λέξω;"},{"c":"E. Hel. 483","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.tlg014.perseus-grc1:483"},". "]],[3,"3",[" in repeating dialogues the Verb commonly goes before its subject, ",{"g":"ἔφην ἐγώ, ἔφη ὁ Σωκράτης,"}," said I, said S., but the order is sts. inverted, ",{"g":"ἐγὼ ἔφην, ὁ Σωκράτης ἔφη,"}," I said, S. said. "]],[3,"4",[" inserted parenthetically, though the sentence has been introduced by ",{"g":"λέγει, εἶπεν,"}," etc., ",{"g":"ὁ Ἰσχόμαχος . . εἶπεν: ἀλλὰ παίζεις μὲν σύ γε, ἔφη"},{"c":"X. Oec. 17.10","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0032.tlg003.perseus-grc1:17:10"},", cf. ",{"c":"Pl. Chrm. 164e","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0059.tlg018:164e"},"; ",{"g":"ἡ κρίσις . . διαρρήδην λέγει \"διότι\", φησίν, \"ἔδοξε τἀληθῆ εἰσαγγεῖλαι\""},{"c":"Lys. 13.50","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0540.tlg013.perseus-grc1:50"},". "]],[3,"5",[{"g":"τί φημί;"},{"c":"S. OT 1471","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.tlg004.perseus-grc1:1471"},", and ",{"g":"τί φῄς;"},{"c":"Ph. 804","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.tlg006.perseus-grc1:804"},", ",{"c":"E. Hel. 706","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.tlg014.perseus-grc1:706"}," (dub.), are used extra metrum, as exclamations. "]],[3,"6",[{"g":"κυριώτατα φάναι,"}," in parenthesis, strictly speaking, ",{"c":"Ph. 2.374","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0018.tlg001:2:374"},"; ",{"g":"ὡς οὕτω φάναι,"}," = ",{"g":"ὡς εἰπεῖν, ἅπασαι ὡς οὕτω φάναι"}," practically all, ",{"c":"Gal. Vict.Att. 9","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0057.tlg019:9"},"; ",{"g":"συνελόντα"}," ( v.l. ",{"g":"-όντι"},")",{"g":"φάναι,"}," = ",{"g":"συνελόντι εἰπεῖν"},", Id. 16.502. "]],[3,"7",[{"g":"Οἰδίπουν . . ἂν μόνον φῶ"}," if I only mention Oedipus, ",{"c":"Antiph. 191.6","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0410.tlg001:191:6"},", cf. ",{"c":"Pl. Cra. 411a","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0059.tlg005.perseus-grc1:411a"},", ",{"c":"435a","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0059.tlg005.perseus-grc1:435a"},". "]],[2,"III",[" like ",{"g":"κατάφημι"},", say yes, affirm, assert, ",{"g":"καὶ τοὺς φάναι"}," and they said yes, ",{"c":"Hdt. 8.88","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0016.tlg001.perseus-grc1:8:88"},"; ",{"g":"καί φημι κἀπόφημι"},{"c":"S. OC 317","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.tlg007.perseus-grc1:317"},"; ",{"g":"ἔγωγέ φημι"},{"c":"Pl. Grg. 526c","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0059.tlg023:526c"},"; ",{"g":"φάναι τε καὶ ἀπαρνεῖσθαι"},{"c":"Id. Tht. 165a","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0059.tlg006.perseus-grc1:165a"},": c. inf., ",{"g":"φῂς ἢ καταρνεῖ μὴ δεδρακέναι τάδε;"},{"c":"S. Ant. 442","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.tlg002.perseus-grc1:442"},"; but ",{"g":"οὔ φημι"}," means say no, deny, refuse, c. inf., ",{"g":"ἡ Πυθίη οὐκ ἔφη χρήσειν"}," said she would not.., ",{"c":"Hdt. 1.19","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0016.tlg001.perseus-grc1:1:19"},", cf. ",{"c":"8.2","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0016.tlg001.perseus-grc1:8:2"},"; ",{"g":"οὐκ ἔφασαν ἐπιτρέψαι"},{"c":"Lys. 13.15","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0540.tlg013.perseus-grc1:15"},", 47 (leg. ",{"g":"-τρέψειν"},"): c. acc. et inf., ",{"g":"οὔ φημ' Ὀρέστην ς' ἐνδίκως ἀνδρηλατεῖν"},{"c":"A. Eu. 221","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0085.tlg007.perseus-grc1:221"},", cf. ",{"c":"Hdt. 2.63","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0016.tlg001.perseus-grc1:2:63"},": abs., ",{"g":"κἂν μὲν μὴ φῇ"}," if he says no, ",{"c":"Ar. Av. 555","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0019.tlg006.perseus-grc1:555"}," (anap.); ",{"g":"ἢ φάθι ἢ μὴ ἃ ἐρωτῶ"}," answer me yes or no, ",{"c":"Pl. Grg. 475e","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0059.tlg023:475e"},"; so in answers, ",{"g":"φημί"}," or ",{"g":"οὕτως φημί"}," yes, ",{"c":"Id. Phdr. 270c","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0059.tlg012:270c"},", al., ",{"c":"Grg. 500e","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0059.tlg023:500e"},"; ",{"g":"οὐκ ἔφη"}," he said no, ",{"c":"Id. Phd. 118a","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0059.tlg004.perseus-grc1: